<title>DENMARK: Danish Great Belt issues 400 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Great Belt issues 400 mln Dkk 4.0 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Friday by arranger Carnegie Bank A/S.</p>
<p>BORROWER: GREAT BELT FIXED LINK (A/S STOREBAELTSFORBINDELSEN).</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 400 MILLION DANISH CROWNS. COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: 15 NOVEMBER 2005.  ISS DATE: APRIL 17 1997  ISS PRICE:</p>
<p>TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
